### Local secrets ###
# Spring Boot loads ./config/ automatically at higher precedence than the classpath, which makes
# it the natural home for credentials that must not be committed. Ignoring the whole directory
# rather than one filename so a future application-local-*.yml cannot be added by accident.
/config/
